Z||000003||wkayl||06-14-2000||11:45 AM||||I swapped the delay system from my son's wrecked 84SE (not his fault) to his "new" 86GT.  I changed turn lever, installed delay board in harness between wiper controll and harness to wiper motor (this is located at base of steering colum.  I ended up swaping motor also, but I think it was because of a bad "park" circut and if you had a good motor to start with may not be needed to change.  It took about an hour||||reg||1
